<title>USA: PORK CARCASS GROSS CUT-OUT VALUES - USDA.</title>
<headline>PORK CARCASS GROSS CUT-OUT VALUES - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
